window.products.push({"id":187105,"name":"jinchan White Curtains for Living Room Embossed Textured Window Curtain 84 Inches Long Elegant Faux Silk Drape for Bedroom Solid Modern Light Filterin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612eLG+iF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Embossed Faux Silk Curtains: Dress up your living room window with JINCHAN ready made embossed curtains. This 84 inches long white curtain brings a touch of elegance to living room with embossed nest pattern on faux silk fabric. Each window curtain package comes in 2 panels, each solid curtain panel measures 50 inch width by 84 inch length. This silky curtain can complete the look of your windows. 3D Embossed Textured Curtains: JINCHAN 3D embossed white curtain has a nice nest pattern on it, subtle embossed pattern adds interest and luxury. Our elegant living room window curtain panel has a silky feel and is easy to install and maintain, featuring 1.6 inch diameter sturdy rings head to coordinate with most window curtain rods. These classy embossed design on solid white curtains compliments your space. Unlined Light Filtering Drape: This unlined window curtain panel features textured embosse on front side and satiny sheen on back side. They cut excessive light and offer privacy. Not only they suit living room area, our modern 84 inch length solid curtains can also be a perfect finishing touch to your bedroom, glass door, bathroom window, laundry room, closet or basement. Be creative with our chic faux silk curtain! Easy Care Solid Curtains: This smooth polyester living room window curtain is easy to maintain. They are durable thanks to quality fabric and good workmanship. The modern living room curtains are machine washable in cold water in gentle circle and tumble dry in low setting, no bleach. Creases from packing and shipping can be pressed by ironing or steaming. More to Discover: Visit our store and discover more window curtains in a variety of designs and fabrics. Grouped by home decor enthusiasts, JINCHAN strive to offer quality home window treatments for the living room, bedroom, kitchen, and etc, including but not limited to window curtains, shower curtains, door curtains, tiers and valances. JINCHAN is a good choice to frame your windows and complete the look of your room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612eLG+iF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B0BN8BG7QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN8BG7QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN8BG7QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":187106,"name":"Boston International Head Turned Winged Pig Sculpture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bHpImVScL._AC_SL1292_.jpg","description":"Who says pigs can't fly? This whimsical resin pig is a great way to add character to any room. Head turned winged pig figurine measures 9.5 x 5.75-Inch and stands 6.75-Inch tall. Other designs of winged pigs available separately from Boston International. It was the love and appreciation of fine design along with the opportunity to create and market well-made yet affordable products that lead Jonathan Newman and Steven Faulkner to found Boston International (BI) in 1986. In the beginning, BI was a boutique line with beautiful hand-made paper products from smaller suppliers in Italy, Spain, Germany and the UK. Through the years, the company developed and grew. In 1996, Boston International added Ideal Home Range (IHR) to their product mix and very shortly after that, BI began its relationship with New York's Metropolitan Museum of Art. Through the combination of these lines, BI's core group of suppliers and BI's development of proprietary lines and accessories, BI has become a major force in the gift industry today. Currently BI partners with suppliers and manufacturers from around the globe to bring their vision to the US market and employs more than 50 people in rustic Holliston, Massachusetts, some 25 miles west of Boston. Boston International's philosophy is the same now as it was back in 1986. Combine the very best design with the highest quality materials and manufacturing, then add outstanding distribution and unmatched customer service. Currently over 19,000 customers in 11 countries are the beneficiaries of this philosophy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bHpImVScL._AC_SL1292_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B00JRRUT3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JRRUT3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JRRUT3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
