window.products.push({"id":187116,"name":"KeeKit Digital Pocket Scale, 500g 0.01g Mini Kitchen Scale with 2 Trays, High Accuracy Multifunction Food Scale with 6 Units, Backlit LCD Display, PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U2ZujfggL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【High Accuracy & Wide Range】KeeKit kitchen scale built with high precision sensor system, provides you with instant and accurate results from 0.05g to 500g. Easy to clean and use, make it an ideal to measure jewelry and cooking ingredients with refined accuracy. 【Superior Quality Materials】The digital pocket scale is crafted to be strong, accurate, fast, and user-friendly. Constructed with a high-quality stainless steel platform and ABS plastic frame, this digital kitchen scale is durable and easy to clean. 【Multi-functional Digital Scale】Built with a clear blue back-lit LCD screen, the cooking scale can convert measurement results between in g, oz, ozt, dwt, ct and gn in seconds. Meanwhile, it will auto-off after 180 seconds of inactivity to preserve battery power. Comes with two trays (13cm, 10cm), which can be used as protectors or scale trays. Meet your demand of measuring different things. 【Smart Button Functions】The \"PCS\" function enables you pieces counting such as pins, beads, screws; The \"T\" function will provide a net weight; The \"M\" function helps you choose the proper unit. The switch time can be set to 60\", 120\" and 180\". Besides, it can alert users for low battery power, overload, and uneven surface placement. 【Stylish Design & Easy to Carry】Minimalistic and elegant design, the food scale's mini and compact size (Product Dimensions: 4\"x5\"x3/4\". Platform Dimensions: 4\"x4\") takes up minimal space on your desk, makes it a pro pocket scale makes it easy for carrying. KeeKit 12 months unconditional warranty with efficient and easy-to-reach customer service. If there was any problem with your digital kitchen scale, we are here to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U2ZujfggL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeeKit","source_asin":"B085M2WVDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085M2WVDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085M2WVDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
