window.products.push({"id":187126,"name":"Amuse- Aquarelle Collection- Round Mug with Bamboo Tray and Spoon (12 oz.)- Gift Box (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c0XxVydKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who says a good tea cup needs to be ugly? Our mug is made of high grade porcelain - beautiful, strong, and good quality, and is very functional and easy to clean. What’s more, this cup has an elegant wooden bamboo tray and matching spoon, making it the perfect tea set to enjoy at home or any given cozy morning The tea mug comes fully protected and boxed! Perfect as a gift for birthday, wedding, Christmas, Mother's day, Father's day and more. It also be a gift for tea lovers in your life. Amuse Home Amuse Home was established in the Pacific North West in 2017. Its origin was a thorough rationalization of the manufacturing process with an eye to creating simple, low-cost, good quality products. Specifically, we reexamined products through three lenses: material selection, inspection process and packaging simplification. Excellent Quality Products In notable contrast to the prevailing over-embellished products in the marketplace, Amuse Home’s products both won great appreciation and sent shock waves across the world. Amuse Home products are succinct, but they are not in the minimalist style. Simplicity and emptiness yield the ultimate universality, embracing the feelings and thoughts of all people. We have been credited with being “resource-saving”, “low-priced”, “simple”, “anonymous” and “nature-oriented”. Excellent Gift Option - for any festival and anniversary like Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Wedding, Housewarming, Baby showering, Graduating, etc. Send the most beautiful gift to the one you loved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c0XxVydKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amuse Home","source_asin":"B07KCDDMSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCDDMSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCDDMSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
