window.products.push({"id":187362,"name":"Chefman 10 Cup (Cooked) Rice Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGoJV4JsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rice is a dietary staple to millions of people across the globe because it is healthy and delicious, and now with the Chefman rice cooker, easy to make! Just fill with up to 5 cups of uncooked rice, add water, set, and forget - the cooker will sense when the rice is perfectly ready to eat and automatically switch to keep warm until it's ready to serve. The removable insert is dishwasher safe, as are the handy measuring cup and paddle that are included, and the compact size stores neatly in any size kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGoJV4JsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B016ZJQXHI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016ZJQXHI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016ZJQXHI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":187363,"name":"Custom Dinosaur Train Party Photo Invitation Tickets - You Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ArU3vJeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will receive the ticket invitations as a high resolution digital .jpg file. This will give you the freedom to print as many copies as you may need and give you the chance to print last minute invitations to guests added to your list. Each Invitation is personalized with your party information. The invitation is sent to your via email usually within 24 hours. We can change, pictures, graphics, wording, text, etc to any of the designs shown in the listing for a custom design also. Any questions, feel free to message me!  After placing your order, please message us the following information you wish to add to the Ticket Invitation. - Child's age - Name - Date, Time, Address of your Party - RSVP - Additional Wording you would like to add. - Design Ticket Number. ( Example: Style 1) - Your email address for proof approval  Then we will email you a proof of your custom Ticket invitation. We will work with you until the invitation perfectly suits your needs.  After your proof is approved, we will email you a High Quality file (.jpg)with two invitations sized 4x6 in order to save paper. Once you print these, all you have to do is cut them in half. (5 x 7 available upon request).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ArU3vJeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ikon Sign & Design","source_asin":"B0055NUPP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0055NUPP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0055NUPP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
