window.products.push({"id":187416,"name":"Pavezo Electric Lunch Box [Faster-75W, Large-1.8L] Food Heated Lunch Box, 12V/24V/110V Food Warmer Lunch Box for Car Truck Home, With Airtight Lid, SS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhA+RD5eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🚗 Hot Meals Anytime & Anywhere --- Say goodbye to soggy, cold, tasteless food. Our 3-in-1 portable electric heater will completely change how you serve your meals. With a simple plug-in, the electric heating box will warm your food to perfection, whether that be at the office (110V), in the car (12V), or truck (24 V). Enjoy your warm & healthier homemade food. 🚚 75W Fast Heating Technology --- No matter how busy your day gets, you will always have your hot meal ready to serve in just 30 minutes. The powerful 75 W circulating heat system of our electric lunch container warms your food quickly and evenly. Using PTC original constant temperature heating, low-consumption heat cycle to keep food at a suitable temperature and keep the moisture of the food. This is the perfect on-the-go truck driver gift idea. 🍛 Leak-proof Design & Safe Transportation --- Soups and stews were always a headache to store, but our heated lunch box has a silicone seal lid and 4 lateral buckles, preventing leaking incidents during transportation. Plus, we provide individual airtight lids for stainless steel trays so that your pre-made food can be kept fresh in the refrigerator; come with an improved high quality thermal insulated carry bag to protect the box during transportation and keep your food warm. 🍱 Enough Space for a Main and Side Course --- 1.8L large capacity SS tray is enough to pack any type of meal that your heart desires. There is always room for dessert or fresh fruits after a hot meal, right? Extra 0.45 L plastic box can store your snacks, veggies, salad, and much more. Both containers are removable, easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Please do not wash external heating lunch box with water, and do not add water to the heating base. 🎁 All-In-One Convenient Package --- Stuck in the car or truck most of the time? Don't have access to a microwave at work? We created the perfect heated lunch box with all accessories needed to enjoy your well-deserved hot meals anywhere you are. Whether you’re looking for the perfect gift for your Husband, Wife, Boyfriend, Father and Friends or for yourself while on the go, look no further and add this thermal lunch box to CART. They are going to LOVE IT.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhA+RD5eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavezo","source_asin":"B0BJVGKLTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJVGKLTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJVGKLTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
