window.products.push({"id":187553,"name":"Professional Cleaning Caddy Organizer with Handle XL, Shoulder and Waist Straps - Cleaning Supplies Organizer - Cleaning Supply Caddy - Lots of Spacio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Heh6fzjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"| PRACTICAL DESIGN | Our Cleaning Caddy Bag is designed specifically as a cleaning tool organizer, so those cleaning tools fit perfectly. A padded shoulder strap and adjustable waist strap make the carrier easy to carry no matter how full it is. Equipped with three round front pockets, one large side pocket, a mesh pocket, and a zippered side pocket as well as 5 adjustable dividers inside. 4 gator clips great for holding an extra bag of cleaning towels, 2 service clips, and an elastic loop. | STRONG AND DURABLE | Reinforced edge stitching, 600 D Oxford polyester, and the removable, cleanable bottom reinforcement ensure that this housekeeping caddy is one tough cookie. Thick, premium quality fabric holds up under stress. Your new large cleaning caddy with handle will hold up whether you're a cleaning pro or you just dabble in light housekeeping. | QUALITY ORGANIZER | 15'' L X 9\" W X 10\" H Cleaner Organizer. Thoughtful design features create the perfect cleaning supply storage. Reinforced bottom with bag feet create a sturdy base and keep the bottom of your cleaning caddy bag clean and dry as you go. Water resistant fabric prevents growth and odors. | MOBILITY | Designed to move with you the way you move! Plastic caddies for cleaning supplies are bulky and small. This bag can be used for cleaning supply storage or for transporting cleaning supplies. Wearable design allows you to wear across your body with a waist support, simply across your shoulder, or just pick it up with the cleaning caddy handle. | FOR PROS | Whether you're a pro at cleaning your own home or you clean homes for a living, this cleaning supply bag will soon be an essential. Keep all your cleaning supplies ready to go. Perfect for the on-the-go AirBNB cleaner, a house keeper, or anyone that cleans a home. Pro Tip: Use the 4 gator clips to attach your bag of extra clean towels for easy transport. We know you use a lot!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Heh6fzjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TERRA HOME","source_asin":"B09SM1JMFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SM1JMFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SM1JMFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
