window.products.push({"id":187557,"name":"Qukueoy Double Layer Modern Art Big Clock 3D Decorative Large Metal Wall Clocks for Living Room,Minimalism, Battery Operated, 20\"x24\" (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5fVBXbAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MINIMALISM DECOR】Inspired from nordic style,this modern wall clock adopts 3D double ring in hollow-out design with open frame face. Without glass cover nor second hands to make modern metal clock more simple and stereo to add Minimalism accents. 【METAL DECORATIVE ARTCRAFT】3D Double circle iron frame makes modern decorative wall clock skeleton more durable and heavier than single layer. Delicately handmade welded contemporary scale timemarkers to enhance the sense of wrought iron artistic. 【SILENT & NON TICKING】Our large metal wall clock uses silent battery operated quartz movement, keep time accurate without annoying ticking noise. Requires 1 AA Carbon Zinc battery(Not included). 【EASY TO READ & INSTALL】Simply modern scale markers on large decorative clock, you can read it easily even stand far away. Comes with a non trace hook, easy to hang on the back hole to decor your room wall art. 【MODERN TIMEPIECE】Oversized iron clock with large size approx. 20inch/50cm diameter. This 3D big clock not only a modern timepiece,also used as handmade metal artwork to decor in the livingroom,bedroom,office,loft,apartment,hotel,bar,restaurant etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5fVBXbAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qukueoy","source_asin":"B09P8L6L2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P8L6L2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P8L6L2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":187558,"name":"Isaac Jacobs White Ceramic Dinosaur Cup, Toothbrush Holder, Multi-Purpose Organizer, – Great for Toiletries, Bathroom, Kitchen, Crafts, Desk, Novelty ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SWMTDg30L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Ceramic Dinosaur Toothbrush Holder is a cute and whimsical ceramic accessory that will add a spark of fun to the bathroom sink, kitchen counter, home office, craft table or child’s desk. This ceramic dinosaur cup is made to be a delightful complement to any bathroom counter, or desk in the home. This quirky, yet functional ceramic cup adds character and personality to everyday items and school and office supplies. This adorable, matte-glazed dinosaur cup caddy will be a fun home for everyday necessities, from bed, bath, and kitchen items, to office décor. This T-Rex may be small, but its tremendous cuteness will fill whatever room you place it in. Your child’s face will light up when they see the adorable design of this Dino, with tiny arms and an inviting grin that appears to be smiling back at you. The cup is ideal for holding toothbrushes, and your kids may look forward to brushing their teeth, or combing their hair, with this sink-side accessory. Use it to organize your toiletries and add a burst of personality to the vanity when you place makeup brushes, eyeliners, or nail files in this multi-purpose cup. In the kitchen, it can be a fun holder for straws or stirrers, and on your child’s desk, this ceramic dinosaur will display markers, crayons, pens, and pencils in fun fashion. Whether you are looking for a novelty gift for a friend, or to add warmth to your own home, this ceramic dinosaur is sure to delight. [Overall Dimensions: 5.5” H x 3.5” x W x 5” L. Inner Dimensions Cup: 4”H x 2.25 W x 2.25” L.]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SWMTDg30L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B08L6SF2RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L6SF2RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L6SF2RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
