window.products.push({"id":187580,"name":"Cutco 21 Piece Kitchen Knife Set with Cherry Finish Oak Block, 8 Table Knives, Paring Knife, Trimmers, Santoku Chopper Chef Knife, Carver, Slicer, Che","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1999.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jca8JyErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cutco is one of the largest manufacturers and sellers of high-quality cutlery in North America since 1949. With over 14 million satisfied customers, Cutco recorded sales of over 50 million in 2005. Cutco offers a forever performance guarantee, a forever sharpness guarantee, and a forever replacement service agreement for misuse or abuse. Experience the difference with Cutco's quality cutlery! This item is a great gift idea. The Double-D recessed edge is the series of three razor-sharp edges on the blade with pointed teeth that protect it from coming in contact with surfaces that can dull the knife. The edge allows the blade to cut forward, backward or straight down with equal ease. Honing applies the final beveled edge (cantle) on straight-edge knives, creating a sharp consistent cutting edge. A 3 steep Heating process transforms soft blades into hard blades, creating the best balance of hardness, flexibility, rust and stain resistance, and edge retention. Blade polishing removes surface imperfections in the steel, creating a beautiful finish, making blades more rust resistant and easier to clean. Handle molding incorporates ergonomic thermo-resin handle design to fit all hands, maximize the full power of the thumb and fingers, and lock the thumb and fingers in place for a firm grip. The two-piece handle is riveted to the blade with high quality nickel-silver alloy rivets. Rivets and the full blade tang are sanded flush with the handle surface, making handles smooth and comfortable grip. As a resold product, Cutco Forever Guarantee may or may not apply. The 21-Pc. Kitchen Knife Set includes: - 4\" Gourmet Paring Knife - Trimmer - Santoku-Style Trimmer - 7\" Santoku - Santoku-Style 8\" Carver - Santoku-Style 10\" Slicer - Traditional Cheese Knife - Gourmet Prep Knife - Turning Fork - Super Shears - Vegetable Peeler - 8 Table Knives - Sharpener - 18-Pc. Cherry Finish Oak Block","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jca8JyErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cutco","source_asin":"B07CWHYXVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWHYXVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWHYXVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
