window.products.push({"id":187677,"name":"HZDHCLH Digital Desk Clock,Wireless Charging Alarm Clock,Bedside Table Clock with Snooze,Temperature,Dimmable LED Display,USB Charging (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PMu1mw51L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"★【Wireless Charger Alarm Clock】 Support max 10W fast charging, it needs you use an adapter of QC3.0 for charging,compatible with iPhone (12/12 Pro/12 mini/11/11 Pro/XS/XR/8/8 Plus/SE), Samsung Galaxy (S21/S20/S10/S9/S8/S7), Note (20/10/9/8), Google Pixel (5/4/4XL/3/3XL) and other Qi-Certified Smart Phones and Wireless Earbuds, just put the phone on the top to easily charge,It is recommended to remove or use a protective case within 5mm when charging. ★【Brightness Adjustable】4 levels of brightness (off/dark/medium/bright) to meet your different needs during the day and night; long press [DIMMER] for 2 seconds, the clock will be completely dimmed, very friendly to people who are sensitive to light when sleeping; wake up brightness It is also very simple, the alarm sounds, or press any key to wake up. ★【Adjustable Volume & Snooze 】You can adjust the high, medium, and low volume, set the volume that suits you.With the snooze function, you can just touch the Snooze button to get extra 5 minutes snooze time.The alarm will sound softly and become faster and louder to make sure you get up. ★【Dual Alarms 】For couples who wake up at different times, two sets of alarm clocks allow you to wake up at different times without resetting.Office workers or students can set two alarm clocks to wake . Addition, you can also set working day alarm mode, so that you will not be disturbed during weekend rest. ★【Power Cord Operation】This clock is operated by a USB power cord and used with a QC3.0 adapter to achieve fast charging; and the battery is only for remembering your alarm settings and does not have the charging function.(Package includes: 1 wireless charging alarm clock + 1 USB charging cable + 1 instruction manual. Please read the instructions before using the alarm clock to make your operation easier and more convenient. Please note: AAA batteries and charging adapters are not included.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PMu1mw51L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HZDHCLH","source_asin":"B0BGWWH4MF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGWWH4MF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGWWH4MF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
