window.products.push({"id":187688,"name":"[36 Inch Wreath Storage Container] - for Christmas Wreath up to 36 Inches in Diameter | Bag Hooks Directly to Your Wire Wreath Frames to Prevent Saggi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614ZsA+QSnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A wreath can often lose its original glamour not from its time in use, but from its time in storage. When you pull out a Christmas wreath from storage to see that it’s been flattened or bent you are understandably saddened. All the loose artificial pine needles falling out everywhere is also frustrating. To add to this, no amount of fluffing of the branches seems to get it back into the right shape. The Direct Suspended storage bag eliminates the danger of storing your beautiful wreaths. Your small and large wreaths, up to 36”, are safe from being smashed as the Direct Suspend system attaches to the frame of the wreath inside the bag. This means the wreath is hanging up in storage like it would be in use, keeping it from sagging to the bottom of the bag and becoming disfigured. To keep your wreath safe through the seasons the storage bag is made of durable Polyester fabric that is easy to wipe clean. If your wreath is one of those large beautiful beasts with a heavy frame, the bag’s carrying handle is padded to keep your hands safe. It will be easy to slide your wreath in and out of the bag because of its large wrap around zipper. This durable bag will keep your wreaths suspended, happy, and vibrant through the years saving you from buying replacement wreaths in the near future.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614ZsA+QSnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa's Bags","source_asin":"B07VNBW7LJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VNBW7LJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VNBW7LJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
