window.products.push({"id":187769,"name":"Homcomoda Rug Runner for Hallway 26”x71” Non Skid Accent Area Carpet Runner Rug Machine Washable Runner Floor Mat for Entrance Living Room Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFS2-mAGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUITABLE SIZE&LOW PROFILE---The Homcomoda runner rug measures 2x6ft with the thickness of 0.32in, perfect size and low profile to be placed in any place you want. Package includes 1 carpet runner. WARM NOTE: This hallway runner rug is folded in package, thus, there might be creases, you can iron it at a low to medium heat to make it flat with a cloth under the iron after receiving. DURABLE&EASY TO CLEAN---Made of high quality Nylon and manufactured by reinforced edging technology, this ktichen runner rug is durable, not easy to fall apart, stain-resistant, non-shed, and easy to clean. You can vacuum the runner rug regularly, spot clean or blot out the dirty part, wash it with hand or washing machine, very convenient and easy to do, saving you time and energy. NON SLIP HALLWAY RUNNER---This laundry runner rug is designed with TPR backing, therefore, it can stay in place on various floors (such as hardwood, laminate, marble,and tile floor), provide safe traction, and ensure the safety of your family and pets. WARM NOTE: Please put the runner mat on clean, dry, smooth floor only, otherwise, it might slip. CLASSIC&FASHIONABLE RUG---Combined classic and fashion together, the simple but trendy pattern can match with the decor of your home easily. Meanwhile, the exquisite and vintage area rug runner can adds more beautiful, elegant, fashionable element as well as warmth and cleanness to your home. VERSATILE&FUNCTIONAL RUNNER---The long rug runner indoor is perfect for many places and occasions. It is not only perfect to be used as your hallway rug runner, indoor entryway runner, it is also wonderful to be used as your laundry room rug runner, kitchen runner rug, etc. Moreover, it can be taken as a gift for your family or friends or other people you care, very practical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFS2-mAGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homcomoda","source_asin":"B09JC97M8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JC97M8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JC97M8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
