window.products.push({"id":187779,"name":"HOME-X Silicone Food Baster with Interchangeable Baster Needle and Sauce Brush, Cleaning Brush Included, 11\" L x 3\" W x 2 ¼” H, Clear/Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E-NjbALqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One of the biggest challenges when cooking meat is keeping it from getting dry. Now you can take your culinary skill to the next level. Impress your guests with juicy turkey, poultry, pork, beef, or fish every time. Cook juicy turkeys with our silicone basting brush and needle-point baster. Directly infuse the marinade into your meal with the injector and taste the difference. The best part about our marinade injector is that it is also a kitchen brush for basting! Brush melted butter, barbecue sauce, or juices straight from the meat on atop your food while cooking, baking, or grilling to really make delicious and crispy skin. Basters also have a variety of versatile uses! Use them to syphon extra grease or oil out of a pan, or use one to disperse the exact amount of water needed for plants. With easy-to-read measuring markings, you can follow recipes to their exact amounts. Made with durable and safe silicone, the bulb dropper and cooking brush are easy to clean and keep your cooking woes to a minimum. We have also included a cleaning brush that is designed to fit the baster perfectly. Cleaning should be the least of your worries when you could be enjoying the incredible food you've prepared! Stop making dry turkey and chicken, and proudly carve up a tender and juicy dish ready to be enjoyed by everyone with the HOME-X Silicone Food Baster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E-NjbALqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08K9DD73M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K9DD73M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K9DD73M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
