window.products.push({"id":187806,"name":"Deep Fryer Pot, Japanese Style Tempura Stainless Steel Outdoor Deep Fry Pot with Thermometer Lid Household Non-stick Frying Pot for Kitchen (Red, 12.8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aiK-CIciS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Durable Stainless Steel -- This deep fryer pot made of high-quality stainless steel. It's more resistant to high temperature (2100 °F ), Not easy to rust, corrosion resistance, with better performance. It is very suitable for frying (french fries, chicken nuggets, squid rings, tempura, shrimp, Peanuts, fish.) ✅Temperature Control & Upgrade handle -- The attached thermometer makes the oil temperature control more accurate, According to the temperature of the oil. The detachable silicone anti-scalding handle slows down heat conduction and prevents scalding. (Don't Wash the Thermometer with Water, Wait to Ccool, Wipe It with a Paper Towel) ✅Easy for Cleaning -- The deep frying pot features the cold touch silicone handle to be easy to clean and store. The detachable wire rack can drain excess fat from food. Used with oil keeper, it can store oil better, prevent waste and make cleaning easier. ✅Safe to Use -- The fryer pot features the japanese-style riveted curved handle, which is safe and firm in use.The design of the beak diversion port makes it easier to pour out the cooking oil after you have finished frying the food without worrying about the oil hanging during the dumping process. ✅Widely Applicable -- The fryer is compatible with all types of fire sources, including the fire sources of gas stove, induction cooker, electric stove; WINCOOK offers high quality products and services. If you have any problem,please contact us as soon as possible.We will provied the most satisfactory service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aiK-CIciS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINCOOK","source_asin":"B09127Q4CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09127Q4CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09127Q4CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":187807,"name":"FLEXTAILGEAR MAX Pump 2020 Portable Air Pump with 3600mAH Battery USB Rechargeable Air Pump-Quick Inflate Deflate for Air Mattress, Pool Toys, Floats,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X9u8XvJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶【PORTABLE & LIGHT-WEIGHT】- Product Size: 3.2 * 2.2 * 2 inch, just weights 5.29 oz. This portable air pump is smaller than a can of Coke. Cordless design, easy to be carried in your backpack or pocket.The rechargeable air pump is a great helper for enjoying outdoor camping, hiking, beach, or indoor storage. ▶【POWERFUL & QUICK INFLATION】- Designed with 2.2kPa air pressure and 300L/min wind speed, this air mattress pump can inflate air products within minutes(depend on product sizes). Besides, our tiny pump helps to make a fire with air-blow on outdoor camping or backyard barbecue. No more meaningless waiting. ▶【RECHARGEABLE LITHIUM BATTERY】- Flextailgear mini air pump with built-in large 3600mAh battery, works up to 45 minutes for one charging. The wireless air pump can be quickly recharged by power bank, laptop, car USB port when on outdoor or charged by power adapter at home. ▶【5 NOZZLES & & EXTENSIVE APPLICABILITY】- Flextailgear micro air pump is equipped with 5 different nozzles, which can fit most of inflatable air products, like air sleeping pads, air beds, air mattress, air toys, swimming rings, pool floats, air sofa, pool rafts, vacuum storage bags, etc. Install the suitable nozzle on the inflation or deflation port, then push up the switch to work. ▶【SAFETY & EASY TO USE】- The exquisite crafts, boosted motor, and solid ABS plastic shell making this battery air pump sturdy, well-sealed, and durable. Pack all accessories in the bag, take battery operated travel air pump anywhere. Please don't use it continuously for more than 15 minutes until it cools down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X9u8XvJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLEXTAILGEAR","source_asin":"B07PFPRYYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PFPRYYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PFPRYYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
