window.products.push({"id":187842,"name":"DALSTRONG - Pizza Wheel - The Orbit Razor Pizza Wheel & Cutter - High-Carbon, Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel - G10 Handle - w/Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hw6OY1wQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PIZZA CUTTER: Exceptionally designed with the most serious pizza aficionados in mind, the Dalstrong Orbit Razor Pizza Wheel is meticulously hand-crafted from, quality materials with a uniquely Dalstrong design that will not only turn heads, but offer high-caliber function for improved and efficient slicing power PROFESSIONAL QUALITY: Featuring a ferociously sharp, reinforced, tri-spoke rotary wheel design, the Dalstrong Orbit Razor Pizza Wheel offers drastically reduced drag to quickly and smoothly sail through even the heartiest and freshest thick or thin pizza crusts, flakey pastries, loaded flatbreads, quesadillas, pasta dough, and more with effortless convenience ULTIMATE DURABILITY & STUNNING STYLE: Engineered of 2.0mm-thick, durable, heavy-gauge #304 stainless steel and weighing in at nearly 1 lb, the Dalstrong Orbit Razor Pizza Wheel was designed with added weight in mind for an effortless cutting experience that will easily glide through any culinary challenge. Providing stain and rust-resistance, this professional-quality blade will last you a lifetime. Beautifully engraved with Dalstrong's signature logo DESIGNED FOR COMFORT & SAFETY: Tastefully completed with an ergonomic and easy-grip G10 handle that provides exceptional cutting leverage and is near impervious to heat, cold, and moisture. The handle design offers a comfortable and secure grip, while the built in finger guard protects your fingers to slice confidently. Included is a quick-dry sheath that protects your Orbit Razor Pizza Wheel whether it's stored away or packed in your knife roll for on-the-go use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hw6OY1wQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B084KNCRSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KNCRSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KNCRSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
