window.products.push({"id":187917,"name":"Tangkula 55 x 28 Inch Large Electric Standing Desk, Height Adjustable Sit to Stand Desk with Powerful Motor & Anti-Collision Design, Ergonomic Stand U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616w+Nc1JVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Upgrade your work space with this ergonomic electric standing desk!While others are still struggling to sit to work with terrible pain and tiredness, you can change your posture from sitting to standing just by pressing the button to lift the tabletop. The high-quality motor achieves the height adjustment quickly and smoothly. And you can feel free to put your full work setup atop the desk, not only because of the 55” x 28” spacious tabletop, but also for the sturdy construction that ensures stable and wobble-free lifting. In addition, there is a built-in cable grommet and cable organizer to help you avoid a tangled mess. And the rounded corner design keeps family members from accident injury. Plus, the splice tabletop is available in 4 kinds of color collocations, so you can choose one that fits your taste. Feature Raises the tabletop to a comfortable position whether you are sitting or standingConvenient button control gets you access to the ideal height with easeSafety anti-collision function for higher protetcion55” x 28” Larges-sized tabletop is suitable for working, studying or gamingBuilt-in cable hole helps you run through the cables and keep the tabletop tidyHigh-performance motor works efficiently at a low noise <52dbDual beam structure and robust lifting columns ensure a large weight capacityAdditional hanging hooks keep headphones or other items at handAdjustable foot pads adapt to the uneven floor and keep the desk stable Specification Color of the Tabletop:Rustic Brown/Gray/Natural/OakColor of Frame: Black/WhiteMaterial: Engineered Wood, MetalOverall Dimension: 55\" x 28\" x 28.5\"-45.5\" (L x W x H)Overall Dimension of Bottom Base: 45\" x 23.5\" (L x W)Length Between Bottom Feet: 40\"Net Weight: 56 lbsBearing Capacity (during Lifting): 200 lbsNoise Level: <52dbLifting Speed: 0.8\"/sPower Input: 100-240VPackage Includes:1 x Standing Desk1 x InstructionWhy You Choose Our Electric Stand Up Desk?√Equipped with high-performance lifting mechanism, the standing desk goes up and down smoothly.√The stand up desk helps you change posture to relieve pressure during working.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616w+Nc1JVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B0BPP5GPXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPP5GPXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPP5GPXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
