window.products.push({"id":187960,"name":"Allure Sushi Maker Roller Machine, Making Kit withTube, Locking Clips and Easy Release Plunger, Perfect Rolls Every Time","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aCiXbZPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Master the japanese art form of sushi with the fastest, easiest sushi machine roller on the market of course you already know all the reasons you love sushi, the taste, the texture, the beauty, not to mention the health benefits of this nutrient-packed delight. And creating masterfully cylindrical is now easier than ever with our advanced sushi roller machine. Uniquely designed with lock-in side hooks that don’t come apart when you try to close it, and an easy release plunger that allows you to create perfectly cylindrical tubes every time – this is guaranteed to become the last sushi making kit you’ll ever need. How it works beautiful in its simplicity, and cherished for its durability and ease of use, our sushi roller will make you look like a hand rolling master in no-time flat. Step 1: Open up the sushi roller tube step 2: Fill both sides with sushi rice step 3: Lay the plunger tube in the middle to create a channel in the middle of each side step 4: Remove the plunger tube and fill with your favorite ingredients. Step 5: Close the lid, you’ll hear a confident ‘click’ and know it’s sealed tight. Step 6: Insert the plunger at the top, push, and voila a perfectly round roll, ready to eat as it or wrap in your favorite brand of nori. That’s all there is to it, in less time that it takes you to order take-out, and for half the cost of eating at your favorite sushi joint, you’ll have perfectly hand rolled sushi masterpieces. So if you’d love to create gorgeously cylindrical sushi right in your own kitchen, then you’ll want to click add to cart now and get ready to make your sushi favorites","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aCiXbZPVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allure","source_asin":"B074SDPJLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-187960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074SDPJLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074SDPJLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
